From fbc5e00c2f2d4363d6747e9f852c13d992a285f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shuxueshuxue <98064968+shuxueshuxue@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 02:38:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/14] Start autonomous foreground work at the CLI request
 boundary

Why: Claude Code persists task-notification input without emitting it as a live SDK user frame. After a valid task notification, its next init or requesting frame starts foreground work before assistant output. Keep task completion alone idle and retain the existing foreground lifecycle.

Upstream: none yet.

Drop when: upstream starts autonomous foreground work at the native request boundary.
---
 src/acp-agent.ts         |  33 +++++---
 src/tests/acp-v2.test.ts | 173 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 194 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/acp-agent.ts b/src/acp-agent.ts
